    (:map :ids ["functional" "emotional" "social"] :source "harness/paradigms/human_resonance.asn:34" :action :specialize :to [ProductValue] :change "JTBD dimensions are useful lenses; emotional and social claims require user evidence.")
    (:map :ids ["hair-on-fire" "friction-burden" "latent-optimization"] :source "harness/paradigms/human_resonance.asn:38" :action :specialize :to [ProductValue] :change "Retain qualitative severity distinctions; numeric bands and scheduling actions need local definitions.")
    (:map :ids ["switching-cost" "cognitive-overhead" "reversibility"] :source "harness/paradigms/human_resonance.asn:42" :action :specialize :to [ProductValue HumanCoordination] :change "Retire 0.3 utility ratio and three-cycle universals; permissions remain explicit local policy.")
    (:map :ids ["memetic-resonance" "social-proof-engine" "tribal-alignment" "stakeholder-equilibrium"] :source "harness/paradigms/human_resonance.asn:47" :action :specialize :to [ProductValue HumanCoordination] :change "Retain portability, diffusion, cultural context and incentives; receipts are contestable evidence, not indisputable social proof.")
    (:map :ids ["recursive-reflection-depth" "reactance-minimization" "calibrated-trust-equilibrium" "cognitive-pacing-balance"] :source "harness/paradigms/reflexive_control.asn:5" :action :merge :to [HumanCoordination] :change "Retain perspective taking, agency, calibration and appropriate deliberation; retire mandatory depth two and literal System1/System2 model claims.")
